Navier.Analysis.PeriodicInitialPhysicalEvolution.exists_scalarCoefficient_productBound_at
  {f : Navier.Analysis.PeriodicDatumFourierBridge.ScalarSource} (hf : ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) f)
  (hp : Navier.Analysis.PeriodicDatumFourierBridge.UnitPeriodic3 f) (r s : ℕ) :
  ∃ C,
    0 ≤ C ∧
      ∀ (k : Navier.Analysis.CriticalMildSeries.LatticeMode),
        (1 + |↑k.1|) ^ r * Navier.Construction.TorusInverse.weight k.2 ^ s *
            ‖Navier.Analysis.PeriodicDatumFourierBridge.scalarCoefficient f k‖ ≤
          C
'Navier.Analysis.PeriodicInitialPhysicalEvolution.exists_scalarCoefficient_productBound_at' depends on axioms: [propext,
 Classical.choice,
 Quot.sound]
